// @description: A compact Bol Processor test grammar (test-data corpus) from Bernard Bel checking "negative context" rewriting — it reuses the exact `_legato`/`_staccato` rule from the Graphics grammar (six notes across three simultaneous voices) as a minimal fixture, with the sequence order varying between polymetric runs. Derived by BPx and played through Kanopi's WebAudio transport. Ctrl+Enter to derive, Ctrl+. to hush.
